"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nm95sB96pSpWEh3GWvwOQg","review_id":"OZzyQGDfF77ru-cp7kwUGA","date":"2015-09-10T17:03:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9487372040748596,"text_excerpt":"Brought my boyfriend to a drag show here last time we were in NOLA and we had so much fun!!!!! It was a cabaret night and the queens were fantastic, the atmosphere so fun, free shots all around! The only bummer was that when I got my tab from the bar they did a hold for $25 more dollars that bumped back into my account a few days later. A bummer to find that they held a charge on my card, but just bring cash for drinks :) GO! SUPPORT LOCAL DRAG!"},{"business_id":"nm95sB96pSpWEh3GWvwOQg","review_id":"xcKZniNg3WDdgm9H6dnYCA","date":"2014-08-27T13:30:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9408944845199585,"text_excerpt":"Great place and great time! We came in for a show and ended up being called up on stage to participate. Was my husband's first drag show and he had a great time. Drinks are strong...almost too strong! The ladies are great. Reba Douglas is fantastic! This is a must whenever in NOLA."},{"business_id":"nm95sB96pSpWEh3GWvwOQg","review_id":"RGBJkQxclPZZQfmCoNgNzg","date":"2015-10-22T14:45:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398577809333801,"text_excerpt":"I loved this place, it was my first drag show and it was fantastic. We were far from the first people to arrive and we still had an awesome table for four. Definitely worth the $15, probably the most fun I had in two weeks in NOLA."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nm95sB96pSpWEh3GWvwOQg","photo_id":"2yru-JvAHwHGfp-pTuuAJg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2yru-JvAHwHGfp-pTuuAJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9299231